"date": 1679011200, "platform": 167, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 400155, "date": 1679011200, "platform": 130, "y": 2023, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 958750, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckjry.jpg"}, {"id": 958751, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sckjrz.jpg"}], "slug": "cult-of-the-lamb-deluxe-edition", "storyline": "A lamb builds and leads a fledgling cult, gathering a devoted flock and tending to their faith through sermons and dark rituals meant to appease the gods. To grow the cult's power and assert its dominance, the lamb ventures out across a mysterious world, confronting rival cult leaders and absorbing their strength. The journey spans five enigmatic regions, each holding its own secrets to uncover. Driven to spread its faith and cleanse the non-believers, the lamb pursues a single goal: to rise above all others and become the mighty lamb god.", "summary": "Cult of the Lamb casts players in the role of a possessed lamb saved from annihilation by an ominous stranger, and must repay their debt by building a loyal following in his name. Start your own cult in a land of false prophets, venturing out into diverse and mysterious regions to build a loyal community of woodland worshippers and spread your Word to become the one true cult.\n\nCult of the Lamb: Deluxe Edition includes:\nNintendo Switch game cartridge or PlayStation 5 game disc.\nAn exclusive 104-page artbook in landscape format.\nThe game\u00b4s Official Soundtrack CD in a carton sleeve.\nA Collectible tuck-in box housing all the contents.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cult-of-the-lamb-deluxe-edition", "videos": [{"id": 82241, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "q-6s2ilUhI0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q-6s2ilUhI0", "title": "Cult of the Lamb - Launch Trailer | PS5 & PS4 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/q-6s2ilUhI0/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}